/*
 * SolarPlot garden scene.
 *
 * This is the approved painterly concept art (Nov 2026), turned into a module.
 * It paints every sprite once onto offscreen canvases, then animates them.
 * The only changes from the concept page: the bed size and the plants in it
 * now come from the app (see `garden` below) instead of a fixed 9 x 5 layout.
 *
 * createScene(canvas, { mode, garden, still })
 *   mode:   'clear' | 'rain' | 'snow' | 'night'
 *   garden: { cols, rows, cells: [{ k, gx, gy, w, h, g }] } or null for the demo bed
 *           k = sprite key, gx/gy = top-left tile, w/h = footprint in tiles,
 *           g = growth from 0 (just planted) to 1 (full size)
 *   still:  draw single frames instead of animating (reduced motion)
 *
 * Planned for Phase 4: move the drawing to PixiJS. Until then this is plain Canvas 2D.
 */
